 to clause 2(b) of rule XIX.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36200","actionDate":"2026-07-22","source":"House floor actions","text":"Mr. Magaziner moved to recommit to the Committee on House Administration. (text: CR H5152)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H35000","actionDate":"2026-07-22","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2026-07-22","source":"House floor actions","text":"DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 7008.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2026-07-22","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 8800, H.R. 8884, H. Con. Res. 113, H.R. 7008, H.R. 6955 and H.R. 9770. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8800 under a structured rule and for consideration of H.R. 8884, H. Con. Res. 113, H.R. 7008, H.R. 6955, and H.R. 9770 under a closed rule, with one hour of debate on each measure and one motion to recommit on H.R. 8800, H.R. 8884, H.R. 7008, H.R. 6955, and H.R. 9770.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2026-07-22","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1438. (consideration: CR H5143-5153)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H1L210","actionDate":"2026-07-20","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1438 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 8800, H.R. 8884, H. Con. Res. 113, H.R. 7008, H.R. 6955 and H.R. 9770. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8800 under a structured rule and for consideration of H.R. 8884, H. Con. Res. 113, H.R. 7008, H.R. 6955, and H.R. 9770 under a closed rule, with one hour of debate on each measure and one motion to recommit on H.R. 8800, H.R. 8884, H.R. 7008, H.R. 6955, and H.R. 9770.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H12410","actionDate":"2026-02-03","source":"House floor actions","text":"Placed on the Unio